{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a vibrant Wuxia world where your choices shape your fate. Will you rise as a noble hero, a wandering swordsman, or a master of shadows? With countless story branches, unique character origins, and a reactive open world, no two journeys are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge alliances with legendary heroes, join powerful sects, and master hundreds of combat techniques. Every decision matters. Every encounter leaves a mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a story you play, it\u2019s <strong>Jianghu</strong>, a martial arts world that remembers you. <br>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/49524532f1ae301d3caae1b0fb1b0811.avif?t=1757820003\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras_big/49524532f1ae301d3caae1b0fb1b0811.avif?t=1757820003 width=800 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be Anyone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey from one of dozens of unique life paths, each with its own storyline, character growth, and worldview. Whether you rise from a noble house or survive as a wandering beggar, your origin shapes your destiny\u2014and how the world sees you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/ee2de9044fe39cc228c391fa133eeb11.poster.avif?t=1757820003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/ee2de9044fe39cc228c391fa133eeb11.webm?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/ee2de9044fe39cc228c391fa133eeb11.mp4?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dynamic, Branching Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a branching, multi-line plot akin to galgames, the story evolves in markedly different directions based on player choices. If players choose not to intervene, the plot develops organically in a completely authentic martial arts world.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open-World Martial Arts Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander a vast and ever-changing Jianghu filled with spontaneous events, hidden secrets, random encounters, and evolving storylines. No two journeys are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/6af90e65b7c2bb7c4877528d7c468615.poster.avif?t=1757820003\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/6af90e65b7c2bb7c4877528d7c468615.webm?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/6af90e65b7c2bb7c4877528d7c468615.mp4?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Bonds with Like-Minded Companions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roaming the martial arts world should never be a solitary journey. Heroes, legends, and confidantes await, just a chance encounter away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Ways to Complete Missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle missions your way: overpower with brute force, execute with clever finesse, or even unravel the underlying intricacies to unexpectedly resolve events.. Every challenge can be approached in different ways, rewarding creativity and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/b1b04463845f7df44390a35449c5bf2d.poster.avif?t=1757820003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/b1b04463845f7df44390a35449c5bf2d.webm?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/b1b04463845f7df44390a35449c5bf2d.mp4?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Various Sects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pledge yourself to one of many martial sects, each with their own philosophy, martial arts techniques, and secret traditions. Train, rise through the ranks, and shape their future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/f17fafba78e2ed30b8aa138268bdc896.poster.avif?t=1757820003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/f17fafba78e2ed30b8aa138268bdc896.webm?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/f17fafba78e2ed30b8aa138268bdc896.mp4?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Hundreds of Martial Arts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ideal fighter with nine schools and hundreds of unique techniques, including blades, swords, fingers, fists, spears, inner mystical power, and more. Mix and match to craft a style that is unique to your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Combat System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in a deeply tactical system inspired by classic martial arts tales. Terrain, weather, positioning, and abilities all factor into victory. Outsmart your enemies as much as you overpower them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/2af3b9439cea2587ebe303fc91f2f945.poster.avif?t=1757820003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/2af3b9439cea2587ebe303fc91f2f945.webm?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/2af3b9439cea2587ebe303fc91f2f945.mp4?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough offers something new. With a wealth of story branches, character builds, random events, unlockables, and world dynamics, no two adventures are ever the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/afad8d2a9448ce763fe90da45bd6fd8c.poster.avif?t=1757820003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/afad8d2a9448ce763fe90da45bd6fd8c.webm?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/afad8d2a9448ce763fe90da45bd6fd8c.mp4?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2727360?t=1757820003","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/24fa973f530ed3ebaf86d010a548b862efc2767b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757820003","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/c57eefe927d9f32c268ee011187847fd15d4ba30/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757820003","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/c57eefe927d9f32c268ee011187847fd15d4ba30/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757820003","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3714080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Update</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/3ca461e313c28a755eb70246838b6bc2.avif?t=1757820003\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras_big/3ca461e313c28a755eb70246838b6bc2.avif?t=1757820003 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>April Update:</strong> Introduced the Sect System, allowing players to freely join any sect. Each sect offers a unique progression path and martial arts system, providing a distinct and immersive  experience.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a vibrant Wuxia world where your choices shape your fate. Will you rise as a noble hero, a wandering swordsman, or a master of shadows? With countless story branches, unique character origins, and a reactive open world, no two journeys are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge alliances with legendary heroes, join powerful sects, and master hundreds of combat techniques. Every decision matters. Every encounter leaves a mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a story you play, it\u2019s <strong>Jianghu</strong>, a martial arts world that remembers you. <br>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/49524532f1ae301d3caae1b0fb1b0811.avif?t=1757820003\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras_big/49524532f1ae301d3caae1b0fb1b0811.avif?t=1757820003 width=800 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be Anyone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey from one of dozens of unique life paths, each with its own storyline, character growth, and worldview. Whether you rise from a noble house or survive as a wandering beggar, your origin shapes your destiny\u2014and how the world sees you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/ee2de9044fe39cc228c391fa133eeb11.poster.avif?t=1757820003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/ee2de9044fe39cc228c391fa133eeb11.webm?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/ee2de9044fe39cc228c391fa133eeb11.mp4?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dynamic, Branching Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a branching, multi-line plot akin to galgames, the story evolves in markedly different directions based on player choices. If players choose not to intervene, the plot develops organically in a completely authentic martial arts world.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open-World Martial Arts Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander a vast and ever-changing Jianghu filled with spontaneous events, hidden secrets, random encounters, and evolving storylines. No two journeys are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/6af90e65b7c2bb7c4877528d7c468615.poster.avif?t=1757820003\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/6af90e65b7c2bb7c4877528d7c468615.webm?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/6af90e65b7c2bb7c4877528d7c468615.mp4?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Bonds with Like-Minded Companions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roaming the martial arts world should never be a solitary journey. Heroes, legends, and confidantes await, just a chance encounter away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Ways to Complete Missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle missions your way: overpower with brute force, execute with clever finesse, or even unravel the underlying intricacies to unexpectedly resolve events.. Every challenge can be approached in different ways, rewarding creativity and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/b1b04463845f7df44390a35449c5bf2d.poster.avif?t=1757820003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/b1b04463845f7df44390a35449c5bf2d.webm?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/b1b04463845f7df44390a35449c5bf2d.mp4?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Various Sects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pledge yourself to one of many martial sects, each with their own philosophy, martial arts techniques, and secret traditions. Train, rise through the ranks, and shape their future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/f17fafba78e2ed30b8aa138268bdc896.poster.avif?t=1757820003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/f17fafba78e2ed30b8aa138268bdc896.webm?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/f17fafba78e2ed30b8aa138268bdc896.mp4?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Hundreds of Martial Arts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ideal fighter with nine schools and hundreds of unique techniques, including blades, swords, fingers, fists, spears, inner mystical power, and more. Mix and match to craft a style that is unique to your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Combat System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in a deeply tactical system inspired by classic martial arts tales. Terrain, weather, positioning, and abilities all factor into victory. Outsmart your enemies as much as you overpower them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/2af3b9439cea2587ebe303fc91f2f945.poster.avif?t=1757820003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/2af3b9439cea2587ebe303fc91f2f945.webm?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/2af3b9439cea2587ebe303fc91f2f945.mp4?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough offers something new. With a wealth of story branches, character builds, random events, unlockables, and world dynamics, no two adventures are ever the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/afad8d2a9448ce763fe90da45bd6fd8c.poster.avif?t=1757820003\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/afad8d2a9448ce763fe90da45bd6fd8c.webm?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/afad8d2a9448ce763fe90da45bd6fd8c.mp4?t=1757820003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Rafiki Makes Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/header.jpg?t=1757820003","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2727360/591722355/abe6689b610e7c0af8f186e3e483ba1715b094d3/1750894747/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749517618","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2727360/591722355/abe6689b610e7c0af8f186e3e483ba1715b094d3/1750894747/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749517618","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2727360/591722355/abe6689b610e7c0af8f186e3e483ba1715b094d3/1750894747/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749517618","id":257154595,"name":"DemoPV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154595/6cb8ffeffc8009e225bb9fb98c864059197ef536/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749517618"}